{"title":"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">Triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_angle\" title=\"Right angle\">right angle</a> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and contains a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Point\" title=\"Point\">point</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab0edf8f9d78d22d294a73ee5fc3007c22b2c64a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PA = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f661c3f77d81a7cbe57b3a1bac50ce850876e2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PB = 6$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b81059fcc3534a6dd34a88918add98c35a504ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APB = \\angle BPC = \\angle CPA$\" width=\"214\" height=\"13\" />.  Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e049532148caaf1c48e37658b548a6255c8d59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b171f8fbb8055a3f8d854d493f599eec30c1fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(0.2 cm);  pair A, B, C, P;  A = (0,14); B = (0,0); C = (21*sqrt(3),0); P = intersectionpoint(arc(B,6,0,180),arc(C,33,0,180));  draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(A--P); draw(B--P); draw(C--P);  label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, NW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, SE); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, P, NE); [/asy]\" width=\"392\" height=\"175\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a7d859f6bc8fed1b64765adfe7eeb757f83621c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PC = x$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b81059fcc3534a6dd34a88918add98c35a504ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APB = \\angle BPC = \\angle CPA$\" width=\"214\" height=\"13\" />, each of them is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3fd424e953ac76b50bf6103875acc049d21d3c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />.  By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Cosines\" title=\"Law of Cosines\">Law of Cosines</a> applied to triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90f6a92b773f52f528b404bd0d2712a65f105073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle APB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/c/fac056ce386c7154c5ed723c55b2808cc0357fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BPC$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/9/569c05c78e0a9090eaf60cef5b7ee29ea56a1e1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CPA$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> at their respective angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, remembering that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/5/5d5d1622f8a8c71982b95ad4bf128be2462ce8db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 120^\\circ = -\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"112\" height=\"37\" />, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/1/3811f0cadac72e5493473cc57a2249d160ce488c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AB^2 = 36 + 100 + 60 = 196, BC^2 = 36 + x^2 + 6x, CA^2 = 100 + x^2 + 10x\\]\" width=\"524\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Then by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d72ec8f992086485e588623ff12198bd20b0be17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB^2 + BC^2 = CA^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />, so \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/8/688be5159b368f96110b866f2f826348c7f9c0d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + 10x + 100 = x^2 + 6x + 36 + 196\\]\" width=\"290\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p>and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96d8f130f6036d0500a38ca00ce1281338256c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4x = 132 \\Longrightarrow x = \\boxed{033}.\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>This is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fermat_point\" title=\"Fermat point\">Fermat point</a> of the triangle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fZAChuJDlSw?si=wJUPmgVRlYwazauh\">https://youtu.be/fZAChuJDlSw?si=wJUPmgVRlYwazauh</a>\n</p><p>~ smartschoolboy9\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME\" title=\"1987 AIME\">1987 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180233\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nCo